caption: Divine Servitors

Divine Servitors (Alliy Group): Divine Servitors are minions of Gods. They all have Minion and Slave Mentality, though usually this accompanies a higher intelligence and eididic memory, allowing them to follow VERY complex sets of instructions. Divine Servitors don’t have souls, and so can’t be priests or actually perform any divine rituals, though they may have magics or other divine powers, since the God that makes them can grant them knowledge of any magic they know, as well as any powers they have through their power talent. Divine Servitors are usually quite powerful, since they not only have all of the Pact disadvantages of their god, but may apply those as a Pact discount to ALL of their traits, effectively being compelled on threat of non-existence to both obey the orders of their god and also embody that god’s pacts perfectly.
